<section class="section">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="card-header">
                        <h5 class="card-title pt-2 pb-0">Help</h5>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion" id="accordionExample">
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingOne">
                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseOne">
                                    Getting Started
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Welcome to the help page. Here you’ll find basic information on how to use the application.</p>
                                    <p>Click a section to view help for that feature.</p>
                                    <p><strong>Need More Help?</strong> Contact support at <a href="mailto:support@yourapp.com">support@finze.com</a></p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                    Account Settings
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p><strong>Access your profile</strong></p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>After logging in, click your profile picture (rounded-circle) or your name in the top-right corner of the header.</li>
                                        <li>From the dropdown menu, select Account Settings.</li>
                                        <li>Under the Edit Profile tab, click My Profile to view or update your information.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                   
                                    <p><strong>Change your password</strong></p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>On the Account Settings page, open the Change Password tab.</li>
                                        <li>Click My Password and follow the instructions to update your password.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThree">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
                                    Dashboard
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThree" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Dashboard provides a central location to view key information and navigate the application efficiently.</p>
                                    <p>The vertical navigation bar on the left allows quick access to all main modules of the application.</p>
                                    <p>Admin can view various reports directly from the Dashboard, including:</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>Transactions made per month for seven months.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions made per day for seven days.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions made in current month.</li>
                                        <li>Subscriptions in current year.</li>
                                        <li>Total number of users.</li>
                                        <li>Total number of customers per year.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFour">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
                                    Budget
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Users can set budgets for specific categories.</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>Register categories in the <strong>Category</strong> module.</li>
                                        <li>Select category from the category dropdown menu.</li>
                                        <li>Set <strong>Budget</strong> for each category.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Limit</strong> is required for each budget.</li>
                                        <li><strong>Spent</strong> and <strong>Remaining</strong> are calculated automatically after each transaction.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
                                    Transactions
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFive" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Transaction module represents a financial transaction.</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>Transactions are processed within their category budgets.</li>
                                        <li>Category can be selected from the dropdown menu.</li>
                                        <li>Each transaction amount is deducted from its category’s budget.</li>
                                        <li>Select a payment method for each transaction from the dropdown menu.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingSix">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">
                                    Category
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSix" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSix" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Categories are used to define different groups for which budgets can be set and transactions can be classified.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingSeven">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">
                                    Bill Reminder
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSeven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSeven" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Represents reminders for recurring payments.</p>
                                    <p>Fill in the required details to add a new bill reminder.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingEight">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEight" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEight">
                                    Goal
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseEight" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingEight" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Goal module allows users to set different financial goals.</p>
                                    <p>Users will be notified once their target amount is reached.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingNine">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseNine" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseNine">
                                    Recurring
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseNine" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingNine" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Users can add recurring bills for tracking purposes.</p>
                                    <p>The frequency of recurrence can be selected from the dropdown menu.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTen">
                                    Financial Account
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>The Financial Account module represents a user’s personal account, business account, and similar accounts.</p>
                                    <p>Select the account type from the dropdown menu.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingEleven">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEleven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEleven">
                                    Notifications
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseEleven" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingEleven" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Represents notifications sent to users about their account activity or updates.</p>
                                    <p>Shows notifications to keep users informed about important events or updates.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwelve">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwelve" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwelve">
                                    Subscriptions
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseTwelve" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwelve" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>Subscriptions provide access to additional features and extended functionality.</p>
                                    <p><strong>Multiple subscription</strong> plans are available, allowing users to choose the option that best fits their needs.</p>
                                    <p>Subscription type can be selected from the dropdown menu. </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingThirteen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThirteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThirteen">
                                    Users
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseThirteen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingThirteen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                   <p>The <strong>Users</strong> page can only be accessed by <strong>administrators</strong>.</p>
                                   <p>Administrators can view, edit and delete user data.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFourteen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFourteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFourteen">
                                    Reset Password
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFourteen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFourteen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>If you forget your password and can't log in follow the steps below:</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>On the login page, click <strong>Forgot Password</strong>. You will be redirected to the reset page.</li>
                                        <li>Enter the required information, reset your password, and then try logging in again.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingFifteen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFifteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFifteen">
                                    Common Actions
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseFifteen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingFifteen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>Create a new record using the <strong>Add</strong> button.</li>
                                        <li>Edit existing items from the table using <strong>Edit</strong> button.</li>
                                        <li>Delete data by using the <strong>Delete</strong> button.</li>
                                        <li>Use <strong>search-bar</strong> in the header to quickly find data</li>
                                        <li>All the registered records are listed in the table.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                         <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingSixteen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSixteen" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseSixteen">
                                    Reports/Charts
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSixteen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSixteen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <p>In this section customers can check all the charts related to their data.</p>
                                    <ol>
                                        <li>Transactions this month.</li>
                                        <li>Budget this year.</li>
                                        <li>Total Financial Accounts.</li>
                                        <li>Total Categories.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions amount last seven days.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions amount last seven months.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions based on category.</li>
                                        <li>Transactions monthly.</li>
                                        <li>Budget allocated based on category.</li>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-item">
                            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingSeventeen">
                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeventeen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeventeen">
                                    Export Data
                                </button>
                            </h2>
                            <div id="collapseSeventeen" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingSeventeen" data-bs-parent="#accordionExample">
                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                    <ol>
                                        <p>In every module you have the option te export the data.</p>
                                        <p>Data export is available in two formats: <strong>Excel</strong> and <strong>Pdf</strong>.</p>
                                        <p>Select the format from the dropdown menu and click export button.</p>
                                    </ol>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>